00:03:20.507 --> 00:03:21.518
Animate

00:03:22.389 --> 00:03:25.408
Text that moves, scenes on a timeline and

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.094
motion that stays on-brand.

00:03:28.855 --> 00:03:31.955
A motion export is composited frame by

00:03:32.047 --> 00:03:35.027
frame from a driven clock rather than

00:03:35.084 --> 00:03:38.088
recorded off the screen, so the timing

00:03:38.155 --> 00:03:40.760
never drifts and the same link renders the

00:03:40.854 --> 00:03:43.170
same clip at any length.

00:03:43.938 --> 00:03:47.066
Animating - keyframes, real depth and a

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:50.394
scene camera to fly over the result.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:54.352
The sequence editor - the timeline itself:

00:03:54.427 --> 00:03:57.287
clips, overlay lanes, trim and split,

00:03:57.349 --> 00:04:00.094
transitions and the audio mix.

00:04:00.866 --> 00:04:04.182
Exporting & Formats - the video, GIF and

00:04:04.275 --> 00:04:07.824
animated PNG side of the export panel,

00:04:07.885 --> 00:04:10.319
once the motion is right.

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:12.227
Record

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:16.373
Record a clean take with a count-in, a

00:04:16.434 --> 00:04:20.229
level meter and gentle coaching, or turn a

00:04:20.294 --> 00:04:22.790
voice note into a finished video that

00:04:22.875 --> 00:04:24.994
moves with the sound.

00:04:25.771 --> 00:04:28.814
There is no separate Record page yet:

00:04:28.884 --> 00:04:31.724
Using Lolly carries it, in the timeline

00:04:31.796 --> 00:04:32.968
section.

00:04:33.755 --> 00:04:36.206
Using Lolly - recording a voiceover

00:04:36.322 --> 00:04:39.169
straight onto the timeline, where the take

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:42.669
is saved and how it reaches the mix.

00:04:43.448 --> 00:04:45.775
Make something in 60 seconds - the

00:04:45.868 --> 00:04:48.833
audiogram scene, for when you would rather

00:04:48.894 --> 00:04:50.844
be heard than seen.

00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:54.232
Utility views - Script audio, when the

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:56.682
words come first and the voice comes

00:04:56.744 --> 00:04:57.869
