00:04:58.987 --> 00:05:00.263
Collaborate

00:05:01.154 --> 00:05:04.003
Two people, two devices, one session,

00:05:04.069 --> 00:05:05.695
edited live.

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:09.435
Scan a code across the table and both

00:05:09.495 --> 00:05:12.375
screens hold the same work, with no

00:05:12.435 --> 00:05:15.019
account and no server in the middle - and

00:05:15.092 --> 00:05:18.141
no internet at all when both devices are

00:05:18.196 --> 00:05:20.070
on the same network.

00:05:20.844 --> 00:05:23.772
Working together - starting a session,

00:05:23.843 --> 00:05:26.553
what travels between the devices and what

00:05:26.615 --> 00:05:29.294
happens when the network drops.

00:05:30.073 --> 00:05:32.625
Using Lolly - the quieter ways to hand

00:05:32.686 --> 00:05:35.388
work on: a share link that carries the

00:05:35.449 --> 00:05:37.544
